---
import Base from '../../layouts/Base.astro';
import skinsData from '../../data/skins.json';
import { getRelativeLocaleUrl } from 'astro:i18n';
const directoryUrl = getRelativeLocaleUrl('zh', '/plugins/directory/');
const skins = skinsData.skins;
const groups = skinsData.groups;
const featuredIds = skinsData.featured || [];
const featured = featuredIds.map((id) => skins.find((s) => s.id === id)).filter(Boolean);
const grouped = groups.map((g) => ({ name: g.name, count: g.count, skins: skins.filter((s) => s.group === g.name) })).filter((g) => g.skins.length > 0);
---
<Base title="DeepSeek Harness 皮肤中心 — 151 款昼夜皮肤 | dshbase 中文" description="DeepSeek Harness 皮肤中心：dsh-themes 提供 151 款昼夜成对皮肤、14 个风格分组。dsh plugin add dsh-themes 一键安装。" currentPath="/themes/">
  <section class="hero wrap">
    <p class="eyebrow">皮肤中心</p>
    <h1>DeepSeek Harness <span class="accent">皮肤</span></h1>
    <p class="lede">给你的 DSH Web UI 换个新皮肤——<strong>{skins.length} 款昼夜成对皮肤</strong>、{groups.length} 个风格分组，一次安装，一键试穿。</p>
  </section>

  <section class="info wrap">
    <h2>安装</h2>
    <pre class="code-block"><code>dsh plugin add dsh-themes</code></pre>
    <p>重启 <code>dsh web</code>，然后在 设置 → 插件 里找到皮肤中心。单款皮肤用 <code>dsh plugin add @whyihaveyou/dsh-skin-&lt;id&gt;</code> 安装。</p>

    <h2 style="margin-top:32px">精选皮肤</h2>
    <div class="skin-grid featured">
      {featured.map((s) => (
        <div class="skin-card" style={`--accent:${s.accent}`}>
          <div class="skin-swatch">
            <div class="sw-light"></div>
            <div class="sw-dark"></div>
          </div>
          <div class="skin-meta">
            <span class="skin-name">{s.name}</span>
            <span class="skin-tag">{s.tagline || s.group}</span>
          </div>
        </div>
      ))}
    </div>

    {grouped.map((g) => (
      <div class="skin-group">
        <h2 style="margin-top:36px" id={`group-${g.name}`}>{g.name} <span class="muted small">({g.count})</span></h2>
        <div class="skin-grid">
          {g.skins.map((s) => (
            <div class="skin-card" style={`--accent:${s.accent}`}>
              <div class="skin-swatch">
                <div class="sw-light"></div>
                <div class="sw-dark"></div>
              </div>
              <div class="skin-meta">
                <span class="skin-name">{s.name}</span>
                <span class="skin-tag">{s.tagline || s.group}</span>
              </div>
            </div>
          ))}
        </div>
      </div>
    ))}

    <h2 style="margin-top:32px">关于皮肤系统</h2>
    <p>DSH 的外观是插件驱动的——皮肤本身就是插件。<code>dsh-themes</code> 打包了 {skins.length} 对皮肤（每对含日间 + 夜间变体），一键切换整个 UI。它是 dsh-suite 生态的一部分，MIT 许可。</p>
    <p>版本、安装状态、实测结果见<a href="/zh/plugins/dsh-themes/">插件目录</a>。</p>

    <p style="margin-top:24px"><a class="btn btn-ghost" href={directoryUrl}>浏览全部插件 &rarr;</a></p>
  </section>
</Base>

<style>
  .skin-grid { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fill, minmax(180px, 1fr)); gap: 14px; margin-top: 16px; }
  .skin-grid.featured { grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fill, minmax(220px, 1fr)); }
  .skin-card { border: 1px solid var(--border); border-radius: 12px; overflow: hidden; background: #fff; }
  .skin-swatch { display: flex; height: 72px; }
  .sw-light { flex: 1; background: linear-gradient(160deg, var(--accent) 0%, #ffffff 100%); }
  .sw-dark { flex: 1; background: linear-gradient(160deg, var(--accent) 0%, #0b0d14 100%); }
  .skin-meta { padding: 12px 14px 14px; }
  .skin-name { display: block; font-size: 14px; font-weight: 700; color: var(--ink); }
  .skin-tag { display: block; font-size: 12px; color: var(--ink-3); margin-top: 3px; line-height: 1.4; }
  .skin-group h2 { font-size: 20px; }
</style>
